					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1052166#post-2155088</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1052166/i-wrote-a-tale#post-2155088</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 12 Nov 2014 18:10:57 +0000</pubDate>
								<wikidot:authorUserId>1361261</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I'm okay with tales being reliant to a certain degree on their supporting articles/other tales. I'm not really okay, though, with a tale being 100% reliant on other documentation and making absolutely no sense in its own right.</p> <p>As a standalone piece, this is completely impenetrable, which is not something I'm ever going to be able to support.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
